    "description": "This app will help to generate AI videos on given templates. Text to AI Video Generator also has feature for text to speech. Speak, generate audio, select template and generate your AI video. Download your video with just a few clicks.\r\nAI Video Generation app is useful tool to create AI videos on selected templates. You can create AI video of your desire. In this age of artificial intelligence, everything is converting into AI. Here, with this powerful AI tool, one can generate AI videos.\r\nMultiple templates for videos are given in this AI video making app. You need to input your text, then select template, select voice and generate your AI video. Watch your video and download with a few clicks.\r\nAI video making is as easy as never before. Just give your right input and generate your videos.",
